stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed : Initial State
    
    Closed --> Open : failures >= threshold [maybe_open() / trip_open()]
    Closed --> Closed : success [on_success() resets failures]
    
    Open --> HalfOpen : cooldown expired [maybe_transition_from_open()]
    Open --> Open : block incoming requests [allow_request() == False / fail fast]
    
    HalfOpen --> Closed : success >= successes_needed [on_success() closes circuit]
    HalfOpen --> Open : any failure [on_failure() trips open immediately]
